# ── HOD fast wallet routing (Netlify) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Serve the lean standalone wallet.html for wallet deep-links WITHOUT touching
# any of the ~18 hardcoded `https://hodclub.in/?wallet=` / `?verify=` builders
# scattered across the customer site, POS, and Cloud Functions.
#
# These are REWRITES (status 200), so the browser URL stays exactly as the guest
# received it (e.g. https://hodclub.in/?wallet=HOD-123) — wallet.html reads the
# same ?wallet= / ?verify= / ?topup= query it always has. The full index.html
# is no longer loaded for these links, cutting cold WhatsApp-webview load from
# ~10-11s to ~2-4s. Only fires when the param is present; the bare homepage and
# every other query (?event=, ?page=, etc.) still serve index.html untouched.
# Path-based wallet link (BarMode emits https://hodclub.in/wallet?ref=...).
# No query condition → also covers /wallet?wallet= and a bare /wallet; Netlify
# forwards the original query string to wallet.html automatically.
/wallet   /wallet.html   200
# Query-param links on the homepage. Each rule fires ONLY when its param exists.
/   /wallet.html   200   Query wallet=:ref
/   /wallet.html   200   Query verify=:ref
/   /wallet.html   200   Query topup=:id
/   /wallet.html   200   Query ref=:ref
